WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.740
Lyanna (to Ned): You have to protect him.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.000
Catelyn (to Talisa): All this horror that's come to my family...

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.400
It's all because I couldn't love a motherless child.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.060
Ned (to Jon): You are a Stark.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.240
You may not have my name, but you have my blood.

